SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "MICC.micc_ra_ao4_1_front_other_zones_6m", "instrument_version": "MICC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2020@2020-03-09", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "Table 9.3.6.1 AO 4.1(f)", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": 6, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2020-03-09", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "MOUNT_ISA"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "MICC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "MICC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "MICC:TOWNSHIP"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "MICC:MIXED_USE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "MICC:COMMUNITY_FACILITIES"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "micc_ra_ao4_1_front_other_zones_6m", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"road_frontage_setback\", \"operator\": \">=\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"applies to any road frontage (not only primary)\", \"applies where a residential activity is assessed against the Residential activities code (MCU accepted subject to requirements or assessable)\"], \"exceptions\": [\"Not an assessment benchmark for stand-alone Class 10a building work, which Table 5.7.1 assesses against PO 22 and PO 23 only\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'Buildings and other structures' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO - AO 4.1 is not identified in s1.6(4) as a building assessment provision; Table 5.7.1 limits Class 10a building work to PO 22/PO 23\nResearcher notes: Zones listed are the dwelling-house zones not named in AO 4.1(a)-(e). 'Buildings and other structures' reaches Class 10. Table 9.3.6.3's note says QDC setbacks apply for dwelling houses and dual occupancies; that note sits under the side/rear table, so whether it also displaces this road setback for dwelling houses (and their outbuildings) needs a curator decision. Retrieved from Internet Archive byte copy of the official PDF."}$q$::jsonb);
